1
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,519
Captain Xu, you're awake.

2
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,359
How long was I asleep?

3
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,439
Two days and two nights.

4
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,520
Easy, take it slow.

5
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,479
What about...

6
00:00:42,039 --> 00:00:44,640
Where are Xiaozhu and Susu?

7
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:47,960
Don't worry, Lian Ye saved them.

8
00:00:48,399 --> 00:00:50,159
The mother and daughter are with the Sanshan Gang now.

9
00:00:50,159 --> 00:00:50,920
They're safe.

10
00:00:56,719 --> 00:00:57,600
Drink some warm water.

11
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,560
Mr. He was killed.

12
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:06,040
I am to blame.

13
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,560
Thankfully,

14
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,799
his wife and daughter are safe.

15
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:17,319
Otherwise, in the afterlife,

16
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,840
I could never face him again.

17
00:01:24,159 --> 00:01:25,159
Captain Xu,

18
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,040
Lian Ye is already suspicious of me.

19
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:31,719
I'm afraid my cover will soon be blown.

20
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:36,239
President Lian and his wife boycotted Japanese goods.

21
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,719
They were patriotic merchants.

22
00:01:40,239 --> 00:01:43,319
Lian Ye has also helped us time and again.

23
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,760
Now that the Japanese are making their move,

24
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:50,519
inviting him to fight the Japanese with us

25
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:52,280
is the perfect opportunity.

26
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,080
Why ask to meet me here all of a sudden?

27
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:20,400
Haven't you always wanted to know what I do?

28
00:02:22,719 --> 00:02:23,560
You're finally willing to tell me?

29
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,800
But first, I want to introduce someone to you.

30
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:28,879
Who is it?

31
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:30,400
Where are they?

32
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,280
Forgive me, Hall Master Lian.

33
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:44,080
The police are searching everywhere,

34
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,800
and given my sensitive status,

35
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,520
this was the only way we could meet.

36
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,520
I'm Xu Ziming, Central Fujian Guerrilla Unit captain.

37
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,199
Comrade Chen Min is our liaison.

38
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,120
Hello.

39
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,800
Your unit uses agile tactics

40
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,039
to pin down Japanese forces.

41
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:04,520
I've long heard of your deeds.

42
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,479
You have my utmost respect.

43
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,919
Thank you for providing the Type 38 rifles.

44
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:11,280
They've been a huge help.

45
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,199
Please sit.

46
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,360
Have a seat.

47
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,520
Having Chen Min introduce us this time

48
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:24,599
was mainly to get to know you,

49
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,319
hoping we could join forces

50
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:28,560
to resist the Japanese together.

51
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,599
To tell you the truth,

52
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,479
my vengeance remains unfulfilled,

53
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:38,080
and I'm a hall master of the Sanshan Gang.

54
00:03:39,039 --> 00:03:40,080
I don't care about my own safety,

55
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:43,120
but I fear implicating my brothers in the Sanshan Gang.

56
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,840
I hope you understand, Captain Xu.

57
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,080
That's quite alright.

58
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:51,520
Don't worry about it.

59
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:55,120
As long as you wish to fight Japan and save our nation,

60
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,319
I believe sooner or later,

61
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,639
we will find ourselves walking the same path.

62
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,319
This time,

63
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,319
besides extending an invitation,

64
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,039
there's another matter

65
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:13,000
where I'd like to ask for your help, Hall Master Lian.

66
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:15,360
Please speak freely, Captain Xu.

67
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:20,160
Feng Xiaozhu is not only Mr. He's wife,

68
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:22,000
she is also our organization's liaison.

69
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,560
Rongcheng is fraught with danger right now.

70
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:27,240
It's far too perilous for her here.

71
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,639
I promised Mr. He

72
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,199
that I would see her and her daughter

73
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,199
safely escorted out of Rongcheng.

74
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:38,839
Mr. He fought for the country and the people.

75
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,519
Rest assured.

76
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:44,160
I will definitely help you fulfill his dying wish.

77
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,000
Good.

78
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:53,399
Lian Ye.

79
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,399
Regardless of whether you join us in the future,

80
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,160
nothing between us will ever change.

81
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,040
What's the matter?

82
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:07,879
Dieyi.

83
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,360
You always manage to surprise me.

84
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,079
I used to think

85
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,319
you didn't want to be with me

86
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,000
because I belong to the underworld,

87
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,160
tangled up in too many grudges and conflicts,

88
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:19,879
lacking stability and peace.

89
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,720
I never expected

90
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,519
you had plunged even earlier

91
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,759
into this turbulent current.

92
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:32,639
Surrounded by foreign invaders,

93
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,800
in our nation's hour of peril,

94
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,879
how could our generation just stand by?

95
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,600
Dieyi, wait for me.

96
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,399
One day,

97
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,360
I will definitely fight side by side with you.

98
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:00,759
Who's there?

99
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,560
It's me.

100
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:18,800
Chief,

101
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,680
what brings you here so late?

102
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,800
Last week, the Japanese seized some fishermen's boats.

103
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:26,199
A clash broke out,

104
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:27,959
and many fishermen were injured.

105
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,720
Today, the Sanshan Gang

106
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,800
received an invitation from the Japanese,

107
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:37,399
to explain the boat seizure.

108
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,399
Chief,

109
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:39,839
you can't go.

110
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:41,800
It's a deadly feast.

111
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,079
Summoning you at a time like this,

112
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:45,680
they must have an ulterior motive!

113
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,279
I understand.

114
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:50,360
But those boats are the fishermen's livelihood.

115
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,079
I can't just ignore them.

116
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,839
When are you going?

117
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,759
Tomorrow.

118
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:05,360
We have important business tomorrow.

119
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:07,800
Yes.

120
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:09,759
It's fine.

121
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,600
Tomorrow I'll take Yan Baichuan

122
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,319
and the other three hall masters with me.

123
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,800
They wouldn't dare make a reckless move.

124
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:22,959
Director Li,

125
00:07:24,079 --> 00:07:24,759
the investigation is complete.

126
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,439
Mr. He secretly funded the guerrillas,

127
00:07:26,879 --> 00:07:27,879
and his wife, Feng Xiaozhu,

128
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,199
is also closely tied to the Communists.

129
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:32,879
The mother and daughter are hiding in the Sanshan Gang.

130
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,360
Keep an eye on the Sanshan Gang.

131
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:36,519
Commander Zhou wants no one to slip through the net.

132
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,160
Yes, sir.

133
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,480
Keep up!

134
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:10,680
What's going on?

135
00:08:12,439 --> 00:08:13,360
Look at how you drive!

136
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,800
Look what you did to my car!

137
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,000
Don't even think about running!

138
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,439
You hit someone and think you can just run?

139
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,800
Everyone, look here!

140
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:20,079
Come take a look!

141
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,480
He has no regard for human life!

142
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,160
This is outrageous!

143
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:23,360
Stop right there!

144
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:24,480
Is this enough?

145
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:34,159
Halt!

146
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:38,399
Officer.

147
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:39,879
Is there a problem?

148
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:45,799
Brother Lian.

149
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,480
Your mission is complete.

150
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:53,879
Come on, come on.

151
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:55,000
Hurry!

152
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:16,919
Don't worry.

153
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:19,159
Once we're out of the city gates, we'll be safe.

154
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:21,200
Thank you all for your help this time.

155
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:23,399
Sister Feng, we're all on the same side.

156
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:24,320
Don't mention it.

157
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:44,679
The Rongcheng police are ordered to purge the Communists.

158
00:09:49,559 --> 00:09:50,120
Just as I thought.

159
00:09:50,679 --> 00:09:52,000
It might fool Officer Yu,

160
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,360
but it won't fool you.

161
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:56,159
Brother Mingyuan,

162
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:01,360
why are you mixed up with them?

163
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:04,320
Dali, get them out of here.

164
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,320
Sister Dieyi...

165
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:08,600
He won't kill me.

166
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:09,879
Go!

167
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,039
Get out of my way!

168
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:34,960
Brother Mingyuan!

169
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,120
They're our fellow Chinese!

170
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,000
You can't kill them!

171
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,360
Step aside!

172
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:45,840
What are you doing?

173
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,159
Put your gun down!

174
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,039
She's a Communist accomplice!

175
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,360
Li Mingyuan, take a good look!

176
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,679
She's Minmin!

177
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,399
Your childhood friend!

178
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:57,960
Put your gun down!

179
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:07,840
You knew who she was!

180
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:11,480
You kept it from me all along!

181
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,440
Put your guns down!

182
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,759
Li Mingyuan, let me ask you.

183
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:23,159
Why did you become a cop in the first place?

184
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,039
To protect the people.

185
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,399
Then what are you doing right now?

186
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,919
Rongcheng needs peace and stability!

187
00:11:30,399 --> 00:11:31,240
War is imminent!

188
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,159
Commander Zhou can't have any threats behind him!

189
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,360
This is the bigger picture!

190
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,960
Purging fellow Chinese resisting Japan,

191
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,039
and protecting those in power...

192
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:38,320
You call that the bigger picture?!

193
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:43,759
Put your gun down!

194
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,480
I'm taking Dieyi back to the station!

195
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:46,279
Not a chance!

196
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,679
I'm warning you!

197
00:11:47,679 --> 00:11:48,519
You'd better think this through!

198
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,000
You're Chinese!

199
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,480
Who should your gun be pointed at?

200
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,440
She's an anti-Japanese rebel!

201
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,519
I can't let her go!

202
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:34,919
Brother Mingyuan,

203
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,639
with our nation's survival at stake,

204
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,960
fratricide

205
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,159
is never the right path.

206
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:47,759
I was never here,

207
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,679
and I never saw you.

208
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:11,200
Hall Master Lian, the Chief requests your presence.

209
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,240
The Chief said

210
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,639
he will only see Hall Master Lian alone.

211
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,679
Chief.

212
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,360
Chief.

213
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,600
Chief.

214
00:13:51,799 --> 00:13:52,440
Chief?

215
00:13:54,279 --> 00:13:55,679
Dad, are you in your room?
